   "locked": false,
   "text": "G02 Fly eight-vessel runs board-vessel, not the daemon",
   "originalText": "G02 Fly eight-vessel runs board-vessel, not the daemon",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 15
  },
  {
   "id": "box_g_G02_b",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 230.25,
   "width": 580,
   "height": 82,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g_g_G02"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 958695909,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2139391441,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000021,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The root fly.toml app `eight-vessel` builds the root Dockerfile whose CMD is\nthe board-vessel entrypoint (packages/board-vessel/vessel.ts). Nothing in the\nrepo starts packages/daemon/index.ts on Fly, so 'the daemon runs on Fly' is\nunverified.\nEvidence: fly.toml ; Dockerfile ; scripts/board-vessel/entrypoint.sh:51-54",
   "originalText": "The root fly.toml app `eight-vessel` builds the root Dockerfile whose CMD is\nthe board-vessel entrypoint (packages/board-vessel/vessel.ts). Nothing in the\nrepo starts packages/daemon/index.ts on Fly, so 'the daemon runs on Fly' is\nunverified.\nEvidence: fly.toml ; Dockerfile ; scripts/board-vessel/entrypoint.sh:51-54",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 12
  },
