   "text": "The real-service e2e is disabled when process.platform is darwin and the\nPlatforms matrix has only ubuntu-latest and windows-latest. The launchd plan is\nunit-tested as data only.\nEvidence: packages/daemon/service.e2e.test.ts:14-17 ;\n.github/workflows/platforms.yml:24-29",
