   "text": "README says it runs on the Hetzner box behind Caddy, but docker-compose.yml and\ninfra/hetzner/systemd carry only the daemon and two Telegram bridges. How g8way\nis deployed is not in the repo.\nEvidence: packages/g8way/README.md ; infra/hetzner/docker-compose.yml",
   "originalText": "README says it runs on the Hetzner box behind Caddy, but docker-compose.yml and\ninfra/hetzner/systemd carry only the daemon and two Telegram bridges. How g8way\nis deployed is not in the repo.\nEvidence: packages/g8way/README.md ; infra/hetzner/docker-compose.yml",
