   "text": "dreams holds one markdown file and no code. qdrant-client is stubs that throw\nNotImplementedError. planner, channels, control-plane and 8dk have zero\nimporters in packages, apps, bin, scripts and tests (channels appears only in a\nsecurity fixture list).\nEvidence: packages/dreams ; packages/qdrant-client/README.md ;\npackages/planner/index.ts ; packages/channels/index.ts ;\npackages/control-plane/index.ts ; packages/8dk/index.ts",
   "originalText": "dreams holds one markdown file and no code. qdrant-client is stubs that throw\nNotImplementedError. planner, channels, control-plane and 8dk have zero\nimporters in packages, apps, bin, scripts and tests (channels appears only in a\nsecurity fixture list).\nEvidence: packages/dreams ; packages/qdrant-client/README.md ;\npackages/planner/index.ts ; packages/channels/index.ts ;\npackages/control-plane/index.ts ; packages/8dk/index.ts",
