   "locked": false,
   "text": "Static grep of every top-level packages/tools/*.ts: 62 are imported by nothing\n(utility files such as crc32, bit-flags, moving-average, sqli-pattern-detector)\nand 60 of those have no test either. Full list in\ndocs/architecture/evidence/tools-orphans.txt.\nEvidence: packages/tools/crc32.ts ; packages/tools/lru-cache.ts ;\ndocs/architecture/evidence/tools-orphans.txt",
   "originalText": "Static grep of every top-level packages/tools/*.ts: 62 are imported by nothing\n(utility files such as crc32, bit-flags, moving-average, sqli-pattern-detector)\nand 60 of those have no test either. Full list in\ndocs/architecture/evidence/tools-orphans.txt.\nEvidence: packages/tools/crc32.ts ; packages/tools/lru-cache.ts ;\ndocs/architecture/evidence/tools-orphans.txt",
