   "text": "OSV and CISA KEV are queried only when someone runs the CLI. No workflow, cron\nentry or daemon job calls it (grep of .github, scripts, packages). Reports land\nin ~/.8gent/security/threat-feed/<date>/ with no reader.\nEvidence: packages/threat-feed/cli.ts ; packages/threat-feed/README.md",
   "originalText": "OSV and CISA KEV are queried only when someone runs the CLI. No workflow, cron\nentry or daemon job calls it (grep of .github, scripts, packages). Reports land\nin ~/.8gent/security/threat-feed/<date>/ with no reader.\nEvidence: packages/threat-feed/cli.ts ; packages/threat-feed/README.md",
