   "text": "The CLI and TUI use packages/cron, the daemon uses packages/daemon/cron.ts,\nboth persist ~/.8gent/cron.json with their own code. Two writers, no shared\nlock.\nEvidence: packages/cron/index.ts:86 ; packages/daemon/cron.ts:35 ;\nbin/8gent.ts:137",
