   "text": "Each talks to api.telegram.org with its own client. The Hetzner units run the\ndaemon bridge; the Fly app runs apps/8gent-bot; packages/telegram is imported\nby agent.ts and repl.ts.\nEvidence: packages/daemon/telegram-bridge.ts ; packages/telegram-bot/index.ts ;\npackages/telegram/index.ts ; apps/8gent-bot/src/index.ts",
   "originalText": "Each talks to api.telegram.org with its own client. The Hetzner units run the\ndaemon bridge; the Fly app runs apps/8gent-bot; packages/telegram is imported\nby agent.ts and repl.ts.\nEvidence: packages/daemon/telegram-bridge.ts ; packages/telegram-bot/index.ts ;\npackages/telegram/index.ts ; apps/8gent-bot/src/index.ts",
