   "text": "The root `dev` script runs next dev over a three-file stub. apps/debugger's\nREADME is the create-next-app default, so its purpose is not stated in the\nrepo.\nEvidence: src/Counter.tsx ; src/app/icon.tsx ; apps/debugger/README.md ;\npackage.json (dev: next dev)",
   "originalText": "The root `dev` script runs next dev over a three-file stub. apps/debugger's\nREADME is the create-next-app default, so its purpose is not stated in the\nrepo.\nEvidence: src/Counter.tsx ; src/app/icon.tsx ; apps/debugger/README.md ;\npackage.json (dev: next dev)",
